# Butler Routes - Darnassus completionist (pack butler-routes-completionist, v1).
# Every Darnassus City quest in the local census (70 quests,
# docs/darnassus-census.md) appears exactly once as an accept and once as a
# turnin. Druid class-chain members carry a [DRUID] marker in the census; a
# future Set 4 druid class guide will build on that list.
# Darnassus is a hub the character returns to across their whole
# leveling life, so the route is ordered for repeated use: grouped by district
# with chains kept together, then accept-based expeditions by destination zone.
# Quest levels run 4-60 (min-levels 4-60); high-level legs carry notes saying
# which level they belong to. Coordinates in Darnassus use the era frame;
# expedition stops use the frames their data carries, set with zone map lines.
guide butler-routes-completionist/darnassus-city
title Darnassus - Completionist
levels 4-60
zone Darnassus
faction Alliance
category Leveling
folder Cities
keywords darnassus, city, completionist
coords live
version 1

step Temple of the Moon — arrival and the Crown

  note Darnassus is a hub for the whole leveling life: come in from Teldrassil and take the Crown of the Earth from Fandral first — it leads the whole zone. Quests here span min-level 4 to level 60 — the steps say which legs belong to which level; low-level arrivals do the early steps and come back for the rest.
  accept 98046 -- Crown of the Earth - Arch Druid Fandral Staghelm; Lariia takes it
  note 98046's pre (935, Teldrassil-contracted) lives in the Teldrassil guide — take 98046 after that leg.
  turnin 98046 -- Crown of the Earth - Fandral's word to Lariia
  accept 98065 -- Crown of the Earth - Lariia; Tyrande Whisperwind takes it
  note 98065's pre (98046 above) fills here — take 98065 after it.
  turnin 98065 -- Crown of the Earth - Lariia's word to Tyrande Whisperwind
  accept 98067 -- Eyes of the Sentinels - Sentinel Dalia Sunblade; four watches across the city
  complete 98067 @33.39,16.77 era -- the watch, first post
  complete 98067 @41.04,43.55 era -- the watch, second post
  complete 98067 @66.46,15.35 era -- the watch, third post
  complete 98067 @89.14,34.76 era -- the watch, fourth post
  turnin 98067 -- Eyes of the Sentinels - back to Sentinel Dalia Sunblade
  accept 98096 -- Sisters In Duty - Sentinel Dalia Sunblade; Commander Truesong waits in Azshara, at 47
  accept 2519 -- The Temple of the Moon - Sister Aquinne; Priestess A'moora takes it
  turnin 2519 -- The Temple of the Moon - Aquinne's word to Priestess A'moora
  accept 2518 -- Tears of the Moon - Priestess A'moora; Silvery Spinnerets
  complete 2518 @36.65,85.93 era -- Silvery Spinnerets for Priestess A'moora
  turnin 2518 -- Tears of the Moon - back to Priestess A'moora
  accept 2520 -- Sathrah's Sacrifice - Priestess A'moora; the Temple of the Moon Fountain
  complete 2520 @39.18,85.59 era -- the Temple of the Moon Fountain for Priestess A'moora
  turnin 2520 -- Sathrah's Sacrifice - back to Priestess A'moora
  accept 1047 -- The New Frontier - Herald Moonstalker; Arch Druid Fandral Staghelm takes it, very late
  turnin 1047 -- The New Frontier - Moonstalker's word to Arch Druid Fandral Staghelm
  accept 5091 -- A Call to Arms: The Plaguelands! - Herald Moonstalker; Commander Ashlam Valorfist waits in the Plaguelands, very late
  note Ironforge's line (5090) and Stormwind's line (5066) stay out — Moonstalker's line is the contracted pick.
  accept 7494 -- Feathermoon Stronghold - Herald Moonstalker; Latronicus Moonspear waits in Feralas, very late
  note Crier Goodman, Courier Hammerfall and Moonstalker all start this chain; Moonstalker's leg is the contracted pick.
  accept 730 -- Trouble In Darkshore? - Chief Archaeologist Greywhisker; Archaeologist Hollee waits in Darkshore
  accept 942 -- The Absent Minded Prospector - Chief Archaeologist Greywhisker; Archaeologist Flagongut waits in the Wetlands
  note 942's pre (741, Darkshore-contracted) lives in the Darkshore guide — take 942 after that leg.
  accept 4493 -- March of the Silithid - Gracina Spiritmight; Alchemist Pestlezugg waits in Tanaris, late
  note 4493’s pre (162, Rise of the Silithid) is uncontracted in Tanaris — take 4493 on its own.
  accept 4510 -- Calm Before the Storm - Gracina Spiritmight; Idriana takes it, late
  note 4510's pre (4508) is uncontracted in Tanaris — take 4510 on its own.
  turnin 4510 -- Calm Before the Storm - Gracina's word to Idriana

