step Craftsmen's Terrace — Lotherias's vest
  when skill Leatherworking 90

  note Leatherworkers only. Lotherias wants a Moonglow Vest set — the Gloves, Boots and Cloak, hand-made as the name says, so have the set in your bags before you turn in. Non-leatherworkers skip this step cleanly.
  accept 1582 -- Moonglow Vest - Lotherias; the Embossed Leather set
  complete 1582 @64.4,22.22 era -- the Embossed Leather Gloves, Boots and Cloak for Lotherias
  turnin 1582 -- Moonglow Vest - back to Lotherias

